## SVG Mechanism: QR Payment Verification Flow (លំហូរផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់ការទូទាត់ QR)

A left-to-right 2D animated 3-stage pipeline showing the QR payment verification sequence (`អតិថិជនស្កេន QR` → `ធនាគារផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់` → `បញ្ជាក់ការទូទាត់`) in a zero-dependency standalone HTML file. No existing `design/tokens.css` or `tokens.css` was found in the workspace, so the file embeds `design/tokens.css`-compatible `--color-*` semantic tokens for light and dark themes and binds every SVG `fill`, `stroke`, and `stop-color` to `--mech-*` token aliases.

### Stages & Token Map

- **Stages (exact flow from prompt):**
  1. **Stage 1:** `អតិថិជនស្កេន QR` (`Customer Scans QR`) — initiates the verification signal along Track `1 → 2`.
  2. **Stage 2:** `ធនាគារផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់` (`Bank Verifies`) — receives the request and emits the confirmation signal along Track `2 → 3`.
  3. **Stage 3:** `បញ្ជាក់ការទូទាត់` (`Payment Confirmed`) — final confirmed state styled with success semantic tokens.
- **CSS Custom Properties (Light `:root`, Dark `:root[data-theme="dark"]`, and `@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)`):**
  - Surfaces: `--color-surface-default` (`--mech-canvas`), `--color-surface-raised` (`--mech-node-top`, `--mech-ok-top`, `--mech-pill-bg`), `--color-surface-subtle` (`--mech-node-bottom`, `--mech-page-bg`), `--color-success-surface` (`--mech-ok-bottom`)
  - Typography: `--color-text-default` (`--mech-text`), `--color-text-muted` (`--mech-muted`), `--color-action-primary-text` (`--mech-accent-text`)
  - Borders, Tracks & Focus: `--color-border-default` (`--mech-node-border`), `--color-border-strong` (`--mech-track`), `--color-border-focus` (`--mech-focus`), `--mech-grid-dot`
  - Signals & Semantic Accents: `--color-action-primary-bg` (`--mech-accent`), `--color-success-text` (`--mech-ok`)

### Complete Runnable Code (`qr-payment-verification-flow.html`)

