### Interactive & Reduced-Motion Contract

- **Play / Pause (`[data-mech-toggle]`):** `44x44px+` button with `aria-pressed` and `:focus-visible` ring that toggles `data-paused="true"` on `.mech-figure`, sets `animation-play-state: paused` on `.signal-stream` and `.stage-pulse`, invokes `svg.pauseAnimations()` / `svg.unpauseAnimations()`, and announces state changes in the `aria-live="polite"` status bar.
- **Stage Inspection & Keyboard Navigation:** Stage buttons (`All stages`, `1. ស្កេន QR`, `2. ផ្ទៀងផ្ទាត់`, `3. បញ្ជាក់`) and focusable SVG stage cards (`tabindex="0" role="button"`, Enter/Space/Escape) highlight the active stage with a focus ring, dim non-active stages to `0.58` opacity (keeping them legible), and update the `aria-live="polite"` Khmer/English caption.
- **Khmer Typography Protection:** `:lang(km)` and `.label-km` enforce `letter-spacing: 0` with a Khmer-capable system font stack; stage cards are `232 × 184px` (`>= 96px` height) with `40px` clearance above the Khmer baseline (`y=206`), `32px` baseline separation to the English subtitle (`y=238`), and `34px` bottom padding so Khmer subscripts (coeng) and upper vowels never clip.
- **Reduced Motion (`@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)`):** Stops all continuous `stroke-dashoffset` and `transform`/`opacity` animations (`animation: none !important; animation-play-state: paused !important;`) and initializes paused state while preserving directional arrowheads, `1 → 2` / `2 → 3` pills, step numbers (`1`, `2`, `3`), and the legend.

